<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Payment Failed</h1>

  <p>Dear <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

  <p>Unfortunately, the payment for your order <strong><%= @order.order_number %></strong> has failed.</p>

  <p><strong>Amount:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_amount, unit: 'RUB ') %></p>

  <p>Please try again or use a different payment method.</p>

  <p>If you continue to experience issues, please contact our support team.</p>

  <p>Thank you for choosing TUTU!</p>
</body>
</html>
